      g_b(R)                     within-galaxy -0.051 dex   between-galaxy sd 0.353 dex   r(logSigma_0) +0.9907
      Sigma_0 (constant in R)    within-galaxy +0.000 dex   between-galaxy sd 0.000 dex   r(logSigma_0) +nan
      |dPhi_b| ref 4 h_R         within-galaxy +0.392 dex   between-galaxy sd 0.348 dex   r(logSigma_0) +0.8345
